      "content": "The diagnostic snapshot is standard procedure, nothing out of the ordinary there. However, given the complexity of the current debris field near the equatorial plane, the transition team is concerned about the handoff window. They're worried that a total transfer of control might leave a gap in active collision avoidance during the synchronization period. Any thoughts on that?",
