      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The debris field presents a valid concern, and I can offer a contingency analysis based on current trajectory modeling. I propose implementing a staggered, segment-by-segment handover rather than a complete simultaneous transfer. This would allow Aegis to assume control incrementally, mitigating any risk during the synchronization gap.",
